<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND (205 TO WIN) 36-1 V ZIMBABWE - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND (205 TO WIN) 36-1 V ZIMBABWE - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, needing 205 to win the first test against Zimbabwe, were 36-1 at tea on the fifth and final day at Queen's Club on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 376 and 234, England 406 and 36-1.</p>
